#: ../../Filtration/Filtration_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:394
msgid ""
"The analysis above suggests that the approach velocity required to break "
"flocs down to a dimension of :math:`20 \\mu m` is approximately 80 mm/s. "
"This is based on a VERY bad guesstimate of the relationship between floc "
"size and shear."
msgstr ""
"El análisis anterior sugiere que la velocidad de aproximación necesaria para"
" descomponer los flócs a una dimensión de :math:`20 \\mu m` es "
